section.content:
Title I of division L of Public Law 115–141 and title I of division G of Public Law 116–6 shall be amended in the first provisos in each Act under the headings “Department 133 STAT. 1102 of Transportation—Federal Transit Administration—Capital Investment Grants”
132 Stat. 997;
Ante, p. 422.by striking “obligated” and inserting “allocated”.
